  "item_short_desc": "<p>Introduce your child to adventure with Rothco's Kids Camo BDU Shirt, modeled after the classic adult fatigue shirt. Crafted from a durable cotton/polyester blend, this shirt offers comfort and rugged style for young explorers. The 4 large button-down pockets provide a cool, utilitarian look, while the three-button front adds authenticity. Available in various camo patterns, this shirt brings the thrill of adventure to your child's wardrobe.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "12299",
  "description": "<p>Introduce your child to adventure with Rothco's Kids Camo BDU Shirt, modeled after the classic adult fatigue shirt. Crafted from a durable cotton/polyester blend, this shirt offers comfort and rugged style for young explorers. The 4 large button-down pockets provide a cool, utilitarian look, while the three-button front adds authenticity. Available in various camo patterns, this shirt brings the thrill of adventure to your child's wardrobe. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
